<title>FINLAND: SKOP SOLD 16 PCT OF STARCKJOHANN.</title>
<headline>SKOP SOLD 16 PCT OF STARCKJOHANN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yrityspankki Skop Oy said in a statement it sold on Friday over 16 percent of its stake in Starckjohann Oy in deals worth over 147 million markka, and that its stake in Starckjohann fell to 3.85 percent.  </p>
<p>Skop would book a profit of 141 million markka on share sales in January 1997, but despite these gains Skop said it expected to post a full-year 1997 loss having been &quot;deeply unprofitable&quot; last year.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
